ideo_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "782023966478773", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974515_782023973145439_749891387670287731_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BBCcZhqlaZ4Q7kNvwFtwcxM&_nc_oc=AdoeU5gxiWOYsLJl4lNjYkhYb9lujH3O9WE2TmL7AzUpjkWYbv6_rOEmbfWbtcHPt6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6n3lktQ-pYrkc5WKztZngTenq-Al12R90nZdFWzk5rSw&oe=6A0B306F"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a snowy town", "keywords": ["photogrammetry", "reconstruction", "360camera", "digitization", "scan"], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a snowy town, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera, whose trajectory is about 670m long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a snowy town, which was computed by photogrammetry from two 2496x2496 videos taken by a helmet-held camera (Garmin Virb 360) and by walking about 670 meters in a town (Laschamps, in France)."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "devel